./docs/plans/2026-04-21-sso-user-identity-linkage/plan.md:304:**Boundaries**: Must NOT touch the password-credentials branch; must NOT modify `identifier_filter` logic; must NOT touch `doSignIn`, `SignOut`, or `RefreshToken`; must NOT add new fields to `SignInRequest`/`SignInResponse`.
