./docs/plans/2026-04-21-sso-user-identity-linkage/definition.md:39:- No `identity`, `identities`, `user_identity`, `external_login_user`, or similar structure exists anywhere under `store/`.
./docs/plans/2026-04-21-sso-user-identity-linkage/definition.md:48:- Providing UI or API surfaces for linking or unlinking external identities.
